Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.70,0:12:30.29,Announcement,,0,0,0,,Once the weapons are aboard the Domelaze
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.29,0:12:35.79,Announcement,,0,0,0,,7th Maintenance Company is to begin loading fighters onto the Balgrey.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.44,0:19:14.98,Announcement,,0,0,0,,Attention all decks: First Attack Force, prepare for launch.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.57,0:19:22.41,Announcement,,0,0,0,,70 gek to the operation area.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.90,0:01:53.15,Default,,0,0,0,,What point is there, in clinging to this planet?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.07,0:01:58.74,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll be entering the atmosphere shortly. Please return inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.47,0:02:26.18,Default,,0,0,0,,My secret police have already found all\Nsubversive elements allied with Zoellick.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.18,0:02:28.31,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll be able to wipe them out before long.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.52,0:02:34.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry for what I put you through.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.03,0:02:37.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Not at all, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.19,0:02:41.70,Default,,0,0,0,,But now your rule is secure.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.70,0:02:46.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Despite the fact that I left the main fleet ninety days away?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.70,0:02:48.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh! Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.18,0:02:52.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm told they will take a minimum of three months to return to the Home Planet?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.67,0:02:58.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Balun is the center of the Geschtam Gates,\Ncomprising the hyperspace navigation network.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.09,0:03:03.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Its destruction means that most of the primary fleets remain here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.22,0:03:08.60,Default,,0,0,0,,In other words, it is now impossible
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.60,0:03:13.73,Default,,0,0,0,,for our primary fleets to reach the Yamato via normal Geschtam navigation.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.06,0:03:14.69,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.40,0:03:19.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Issue the order...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.04,0:03:21.57,Default,,0,0,0,,...to sink the Yamato.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.78,0:03:24.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Would you do it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.08,0:03:26.70,Default,,0,0,0,,At the cost of my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.70,0:03:29.91,Default,,0,0,0,,We've prepared the best crew for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.91,0:03:35.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Should you defeat the Yamato,\Nyour wife's punishment will be reduced.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.71,0:03:39.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I am grateful, Deputy Lord Hyss.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.22,0:03:44.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Elk, I have one more request...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.43,0:03:47.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Just for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.49,0:04:05.45,Default,,0,0,0,,You left the medical room. Makoto was looking for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.66,0:04:10.45,Default,,0,0,0,,So that's where you take off from, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.83,0:04:15.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Well? Did you come to retrieve me?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.04,0:04:17.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Something like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.38,0:04:25.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Shinohara, you were in my brother Akio's squad, weren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.68,0:04:28.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, he was a good man.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.18,0:04:35.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Sword 3 was his code name.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.15,0:04:40.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I see...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.73,0:04:43.74,Default,,0,0,0,,He never discussed that stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.78,0:04:46.72,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the kind of guy he was.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.74,0:04:49.24,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the kind of guy he was.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.54,0:04:56.08,Default,,0,0,0,,We've made it to the Large Magellanic Cloud, haven't we?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.50,0:04:58.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, we have.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.67,0:05:00.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Congratulations.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.01,0:05:06.34,Default,,0,0,0,,You were right. I never expected we'd ever get this far.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.84,0:05:12.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know if "right" is the way I'd put it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.10,0:05:14.23,Default,,0,0,0,,But there is only one reality.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.48,0:05:20.11,Default,,0,0,0,,And the reality is that we made it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.16,0:05:33.12,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you looking at?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.12,0:05:34.37,Default,,0,0,0,,The stars.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.00,0:05:37.96,Default,,0,0,0,,The Tarantula Nebula? Impressive, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.13,0:05:41.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Beyond it lies Iscandar.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.59,0:05:47.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I wanted to come home with Sasha.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.59,0:05:50.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Yurisha...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.47,0:05:55.18,Default,,0,0,0,,That's dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.18,0:05:57.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Hoshina.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.69,0:06:03.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Yuria says she wants you to hug her.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.57,0:06:06.95,Default,,0,0,0,,What is a hug?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.45,0:06:10.82,Default,,0,0,0,,An Iscandarian on board the Yamato?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.16,0:06:13.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Unbelievable.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.08,0:06:15.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Remember when Cerestella went to Balun?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.91,0:06:19.31,Default,,0,0,0,,She was investigating the Aquarius ruins, yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.31,0:06:23.32,Default,,0,0,0,,She used the ruins to retrieve information on the Yamato.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.32,0:06:25.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't know that was even possible!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.30,0:06:28.84,Default,,0,0,0,,She is a witch, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.84,0:06:32.64,Default,,0,0,0,,And so, I have another mission now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.33,0:06:58.87,Default,,0,0,0,,We're landing. Prepare to disembark!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.86,0:07:28.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing but children and old men, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.94,0:07:31.22,Default,,0,0,0,,"The best crew," right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.22,0:07:33.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Only four carriers?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.74,0:07:35.12,Default,,0,0,0,,No complaints, Berger.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.12,0:07:39.46,Default,,0,0,0,,The Imperial Guard controls the Homeland Defense Fleets.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.46,0:07:41.25,Default,,0,0,0,,They won't give us more.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.04,0:07:43.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Barlen!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.17,0:07:46.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Heydeln, is that you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.13,0:07:48.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't think you were still alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.17,0:07:51.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Same to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.05,0:07:53.11,Default,,0,0,0,,It's been since the Gorni Campaign.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.11,0:07:54.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.26,0:07:59.64,Default,,0,0,0,,We have old ships and young men. Can you do this?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.98,0:08:04.65,Default,,0,0,0,,You were the one who said that a soldier comes of age on the battlefield.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.48,0:08:06.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm counting on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.48,0:08:07.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Zar Belk!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.65,0:08:10.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Attention!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.86,0:08:15.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Flakken, I'll need your help once more.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.95,0:08:20.04,Default,,0,0,0,,The air in Baleras is horrible.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.62,0:08:23.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd jump at the chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.00,0:08:25.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm counting on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.67,0:08:29.67,Default,,0,0,0,,A squad of second-class Garmillas subjects?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.67,0:08:31.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Volunteers from Planet Zaltz.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.88,0:08:33.68,Default,,0,0,0,,From a conquered territory?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.38,0:08:37.39,Default,,0,0,0,,They're from the same planet as Schultz.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.22,0:08:42.81,Default,,0,0,0,,We are the 442nd Special Platoon, Specialized Warfare Group B.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.23,0:08:48.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I have an extremely important mission for you. You're aware of it, correct?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.57,0:08:51.57,Default,,0,0,0,,We will do all we can for Garmillas.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.94,0:08:54.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not sure we can trust them.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.13,0:09:50.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Regular Wave Motion Gun inspection is complete.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.46,0:09:53.26,Default,,0,0,0,,All responsible personnel should report to Weapons Officer.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.47,0:10:02.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep this thing in good shape.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.35,0:10:03.97,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter how often the Garmillans show up,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.97,0:10:06.06,Default,,0,0,0,,the Yamato is invincible so long as we have this.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.06,0:10:06.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.69,0:10:07.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Captain...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.56,0:10:09.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you need something?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.10,0:10:11.61,Default,,0,0,0,,No, it's nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.99,0:10:16.53,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong with him?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.53,0:10:17.61,Default,,0,0,0,,No idea...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.00,0:10:29.12,Default,,0,0,0,,What lies back there is a tool of war.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.67,0:10:37.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Wave Motion Energy is not a weapon.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.51,0:10:40.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You mustn't make it a weapon.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.60,0:10:45.35,Default,,0,0,0,,It is to enable you to cross the stars.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.64,0:10:51.67,Default,,0,0,0,,The plans you received a year ago were to take you to Iscandar.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.52,0:10:59.86,Default,,0,0,0,,During our journey of 168,000 light years, we required protection from Garmillas.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.16,0:11:09.21,Default,,0,0,0,,And therefore, Sanada created it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.68,0:11:13.38,Default,,0,0,0,,But that makes you no different than the Garmillans
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.50,0:11:18.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Is the wave motion gun truly only for your protection?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.68,0:11:24.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd like for you to believe in us.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.19,0:11:34.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Why...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.32,0:11:37.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Why not ask me?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.99,0:11:42.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Why we didn't bring you
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.53,0:11:47.95,Default,,0,0,0,,the Cosmo Reverser directly,\Nrather than the Wave Motion Engine?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.46,0:11:58.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Perhaps we are being tested.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.59,0:12:02.88,Default,,0,0,0,,By you... By your people.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.10,0:12:08.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I simply observe.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.10,0:12:13.77,Default,,0,0,0,,It is my sister, Starsha's job to decide.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.86,0:12:18.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I hope you'll watch carefully.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.11,0:12:20.74,Default,,0,0,0,,And see if the Yamato...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.65,0:12:27.41,Default,,0,0,0,,No, whether humanity is worth saving.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.09,0:12:46.68,Default,,0,0,0,,A top-secret prototype... No less.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.68,0:12:50.14,Default,,0,0,0,,It wasn't easy convincing Weapons Research.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.14,0:12:51.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm grateful.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.77,0:12:55.81,Default,,0,0,0,,It's fine... I'm accustomed to your requests.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.81,0:13:00.82,Default,,0,0,0,,But why would you need such a thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.65,0:13:09.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't this a drill for asteroid mining? Why load it as a bomb?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.08,0:13:12.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Who knows? I'll never understand the higher-ups.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.34,0:13:27.64,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing with him?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.61,0:13:25.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Lieutenant Brigadier!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.55,0:13:29.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay calm.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.60,0:13:33.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I've done nothing to make them arrest me. They'll see that when they investigate.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.56,0:13:34.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Lieutenant Brigadier Helder!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.52,0:13:36.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Lieutenant Brigadier Helder!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.27,0:13:42.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn you!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.07,0:13:48.66,Default,,0,0,0,,This is what's really happening in the home we're risking our lives to protect.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.66,0:13:50.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are you guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.87,0:13:54.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Lower Storm Leader Melda Ditz, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.09,0:14:06.17,Default,,0,0,0,,The Tarantula Nebula, at the edge of the Large Magellanic Cloud,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.17,0:14:10.64,Default,,0,0,0,,is filled with interstellar medium and ion storms.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.39,0:14:14.72,Default,,0,0,0,,These seven stars make up the nebula.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.72,0:14:17.39,Default,,0,0,0,,For convenience, we'll call them the Rainbow Cluster.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.39,0:14:20.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Heading through this is our fastest course.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.69,0:14:27.11,Default,,0,0,0,,But degenerate stars comprise this cluster, and it's also filled with relativistic jets.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.11,0:14:29.53,Default,,0,0,0,,It is the most dangerous area along our course.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.53,0:14:32.78,Default,,0,0,0,,We're already seeing issues with the Cosmo Radar.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.78,0:14:34.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't we just warp through?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.95,0:14:39.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Even at maximum warp, we wouldn't make it through. It's too big.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.17,0:14:43.80,Default,,0,0,0,,It'll be difficult to get through.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.80,0:14:47.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, so I've charted a course around it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.18,0:14:53.81,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the course we believe the Yamato will take on their way to Salezar.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.81,0:14:56.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Then the quickest route is through the Rainbow Cluster?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.43,0:15:01.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Heading through that would be suicide. They aren't that stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.27,0:15:06.36,Default,,0,0,0,,If they plan to avoid the Rainbow Cluster, that doesn't leave many routes.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.44,0:15:08.74,Default,,0,0,0,,No...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.74,0:15:11.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if we did gain a step on them at Balun,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.95,0:15:18.58,Default,,0,0,0,,navigating around would give the enemy time to mount a counterattack.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.58,0:15:23.56,Default,,0,0,0,,The enemy is also unlikely to expect us to go through a dangerous area like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.56,0:15:28.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, we will continue through the Rainbow Cluster, to Iscandar.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.72,0:15:32.18,Default,,0,0,0,,As we travel through the cluster, we will maintain alert status
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.18,0:15:34.60,Default,,0,0,0,,and carefully monitor anti-air scanners.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.76,0:16:15.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Balgrey ready to launch.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.39,0:16:17.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Lambea ready to launch.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.47,0:16:20.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Schderg ready to launch.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.14,0:16:22.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Daurold ready to launch.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.14,0:16:26.19,Default,,0,0,0,,All ships ready to launch.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.15,0:16:28.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Launch all ships.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.50,0:17:24.50,Default,,0,0,0,,The fleet is passing Second Baleras.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.55,0:17:35.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I will now announce our course.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.38,0:17:39.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Course 728. Our destination is the Rainbow Cluster.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.26,0:17:40.39,Default,,0,0,0,,The Rainbow Cluster?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.39,0:17:41.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.10,0:17:50.90,Default,,0,0,0,,But will they really come through such a dangerous area?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.90,0:17:52.36,Default,,0,0,0,,They will come.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.78,0:17:56.36,Default,,0,0,0,,If the captain of the Yamato is the man I think him to be,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.36,0:17:59.37,Default,,0,0,0,,they will come through the Rainbow Cluster.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.47,0:18:19.89,Default,,0,0,0,,High-density ionized gas!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.89,0:18:21.64,Default,,0,0,0,,S-Switching helm to manual!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.64,0:18:23.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Radar and sensors aren't working correctly.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.95,0:18:25.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Switching to optic mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.52,0:18:28.81,Default,,0,0,0,,So we'll have to rely on optic mode?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.81,0:18:31.48,Default,,0,0,0,,We're like an old sailing ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.27,0:18:36.03,Default,,0,0,0,,If the enemy is the commander we faced before...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.99,0:18:44.41,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a storm up there, Heyni.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.41,0:18:46.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Sounds good!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.16,0:18:48.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Ship detected at nine o'clock.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.00,0:18:51.63,Default,,0,0,0,,There it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.17,0:18:56.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Message from the Hound! The sheep has entered the lost forest.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.21,0:18:58.13,Default,,0,0,0,,You were right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.51,0:18:59.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.01,0:19:03.05,Default,,0,0,0,,We will commence the operation.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.23,0:19:11.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Fighter Group 1, prepare for launch.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.98,0:19:12.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Captain...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.34,0:19:15.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll count on you for the rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.53,0:19:18.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Good luck, Rear Brigadier.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.84,0:20:22.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Will they attack in rough seas like these?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.24,0:20:24.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Shino isn't with us this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.30,0:20:25.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be so scared, Kobashi.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.97,0:20:27.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not scared!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.10,0:20:28.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.43,0:20:31.68,Default,,0,0,0,,If anything happens, I'll work hard enough to make up for their part.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.94,0:20:34.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll hold you to that, Daikuhara.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.27,0:20:36.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep quiet, Sawamura.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.15,0:20:42.07,Default,,0,0,0,,If they attack under these conditions, only we can protect the Yamato.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.07,0:20:44.57,Default,,0,0,0,,But aren't we leaving the missus?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.57,0:20:47.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, she's our ace in the hole.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.53,0:20:54.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't trust aliens. If you do, we'll all die... We'll all die!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.42,0:21:04.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Breaking through turbulence layer!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.55,0:21:07.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Seas are calm out here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.81,0:21:12.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Something on radar!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.98,0:21:16.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Enemy fighter formation. Twenty-seven light seconds away.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.56,0:21:18.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Battle stations!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.40,0:21:21.75,Default,,0,0,0,,All crew to battle stations. Fighter Group, launch immediately!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.20,0:21:29.41,Default,,0,0,0,,They're coming... And bringing the war with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.44,0:21:42.46,Default,,0,0,0,,One hundred. Kato... Launching!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.26,0:21:51.99,Default,,0,0,0,,All fighters have launched!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.32,0:24:16.85,Default,,0,0,0,,A pack of wolves descend. An invisible hunting dog\Nlurks in the shadows, ready to strike.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.85,0:24:25.92,Default,,0,0,0,,The battle begins in a rainbow sky.\NThe time has come to decide the final victor.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.92,0:24:29.88,Default,,0,0,0,,This battle is a test that must be passed.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.13,0:24:32.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Next time: Under a Rainbow Sun.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.30,0:24:38.85,Default,,0,0,0,,There are 245 days left before humanity is extinct.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.50,0:22:44.30,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}Among the distant stars
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.30,0:22:48.39,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}Can you hear the wandering souls?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.39,0:23:02.36,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,500)}In this galaxy, they can forever rest in peace
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.36,0:23:06.03,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Requiem of separation
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.03,0:23:09.53,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}With this requiem
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.53,0:23:12.16,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,500)}Sing Along!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.20,0:23:16.79,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Voices sing to praise
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.79,0:23:20.42,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}An unforgettable memory
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.42,0:23:25.38,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,500)}And we’ll never forget your name
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.97,0:23:32.68,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}Farewell friend,\Nmy sorrow
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.68,0:23:35.10,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}Will not run out
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.10,0:23:40.19,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,500)}Someday in this sea of stars
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.19,0:23:42.32,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Surely
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.32,0:23:43.99,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Pray for the Earth!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.99,0:23:45.99,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}The oath
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.99,0:23:47.66,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Pray for the dream!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.66,0:23:49.62,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}The ideal
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.87,0:23:58.92,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,1000)}Last forever!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.54,0:00:22.50,OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur7\be2}Farewell, Earth
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.50,0:00:26.13,OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur7\be2}The ship that is departing is
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.13,0:00:30.30,OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur7\be2}The Space Battleship
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.30,0:00:35.39,OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,2000)\blur7\be2}Yamato
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.77,0:00:39.52,OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur7\pos(777,60)\be2}It departs now to Iscandar,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.52,0:00:44.36,OP,,900,0,0,,{\an9\fad(200,200)\blur7\be2}at the end of the cosmos,\Nbearing its fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.36,0:00:51.91,OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur7\be2}"We will come back, no matter what it takes"
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.91,0:01:00.71,OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur7\be2}Answer with a smile to the waving people
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.50,0:01:05.21,OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur7\be2}Going far from the Galaxy towards Iscandar
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.21,0:01:08.63,OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur7\be2}A faint gleam of hope
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.63,0:01:16.18,OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,3000)\blur7\be2}The Space Battleship Yamato
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.07,0:22:29.80,EP TS,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1414,840)\blur7.5\shad0\blur7.5\3aH&90&\4aH&99&\fad(1250,1700)}Episode 19
