Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.93,0:15:51.97,tsing 2,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.5\frz29.69\pos(903,706.5)\c&H464A41&\3c&H5F6259&}09 - minutes
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.90,0:09:08.40,tsing 3,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,100)}Our noble home,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.40,0:09:12.74,tsing 3,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Planet where the blue flowers blossom.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.74,0:09:17.45,tsing 3,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Sing a song of joy!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.45,0:09:26.67,tsing 3,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,2000)}May god's grace always be with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.59,0:09:36.60,tsing 3,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,2000)}Ghale Garmillon!\NHail to the victory of our home.
